              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 1:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.1.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ku baabaire nibakishemererwa, haija abantu b'abanyarurembo abataine mugasho, baayehinguririza egyo nju, baateera orwigi, baagambira ogwo mugurusi nyineeka, bati: Shohoza ogwo mushaija owaija omu nju yaawe, tumumanye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omushaija nyineeka yaashohora ahu baabaire bari, yaabagira ati: Beene waitu, murekye, naabeeshengyereza, mutakora ekibi ekirikwingana kityo; ogu mushaija yaataahire omu nju yangye, mutakora ekihagaro ekirikushusha kityo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reeba, hariho muhara wangye empangare, n'omukazi w'ogu mushaija; ka mbe nibo naashohoza hati, mubashiishe, mubagire nk'oku murikwenda; kwonka omushaija ogu mutamukoraho ekihagaro ekirikushusha kityo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.6.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kut 6:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abo bashaija baayanga kumuhurira; ogwo mushaija omugyenyi nikwo kukwata omukazi we w'ekinyanshunju, akamushohoza ahu bari, bakamumanya, bakamushiisha ekiro kyona okuhitsya omu kasheeshe; ku bwabaire nibutaagurikana, baamurekura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukazi yaija nibusheesha, yaagwa aha rwigi rw'enju y'ogwo mushaija, omu mukama we yaabaire ari, okuhitsya obu bwaseesire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukama we ku yaimukire omu kasheeshe, yaigura enyigi z'enju, naashohora kugyenda, yaashanga ogwo mukazi we w'ekinyanshunju agwire ahansi, engaro ze ziri omu kisasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.20.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bar 20:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yaamugira ati: Imuka tugyende. Akateezo kaabura; bwanyima omushaija yaamuta aha ndogoya, yaimuka, yaaza owaabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
