            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abaakireebire boona baagira bati: Ekintu nk'eki tikikakorwaga, kandi tikikareebwaga, okwiha obu Abaisraeli baaruga omu nsi ya Misri n'okuhitsya hati. Mukiteekateekyeho, mukihanuureho, kandi mukigambeho.",
